# Insight (Blog / Posts)

Public blog surface lives under **`/insight`**. Content source: **CMS public API** (`cms.gonline.id`) via `src/lib/cms/articles.ts`.

## Config
- `CMS_API_URL` (default `https://cms.gonline.id`)
- `CMS_BRAND_ID` (default `gonline`)
- `CMS_PREVIEW_SECRET` — server-only; enable draft preview with `?preview=1`
- Feature required on CMS brand: `articles`

## Endpoints used
- `GET /api/public/articles?brandId=`
- `GET /api/public/articles/{slug}?brandId=`
- `GET /api/public/articles/{slug}/related?brandId=`
- `GET /api/public/article-categories?brandId=`

## Domain
Use `Article` / `ArticleCategory` from `src/types/article.ts`.
- `category` = CMS category **id** (e.g. `web-development`)
- `categoryLabel` = display label
- `highlight` / `coverImage` are FE aliases of `highlighted` / `thumbnail`
- Routes: `/insight` · `/insight/[category]/[slug]` (`category` must match id)

## Patterns
- Server Components fetch via `listArticles` / `getArticleBySlug` / `getRelatedArticles`
- Filters use CMS query params (category, q, highlighted, page, limit)
- Related block uses `/related` — do not re-implement ranking client-side
- Never import `CMS_PREVIEW_SECRET` into client components

## Do / Don't
- ✅ Reuse `NewsCard`, featured, recommendations
- ✅ Prefer `articlePath(article)` for hrefs
- ❌ Google Sheets for articles
- ❌ Expose preview secret in client bundles
